(4967873, 722434, 47541, '<td valign="top">So now 3 of your views are from me.  This looks good in thumb and great bigger.  The selective desat is almost perfect (I''d prefer there to be no colour in the cargo of the truck) and it feels natural - thats good.  Great drama in the sky.  Hate the title, I prefer a title not to force feed me the subject.  One of two 10''s from me</td>', 'So now 3 of your views are from me.  This looks good in thumb and great bigger.  The selective desat is almost perfect (I''d prefer there to be no colour in the cargo of the truck) and it feels natural - thats good.  Great drama in the sky.  Hate the title, I prefer a title not to force feed me the subject.  One of two 10''s from me', '2008-09-22 06:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4967876, 722168, 47541, '<td valign="top">Something about this strikes a chord with me.  I think the scale is the key, I love the moon there to offset the little church (I''m sure it''s little in real life).  One of two 10''s from me.</td>', 'Something about this strikes a chord with me.  I think the scale is the key, I love the moon there to offset the little church (I''m sure it''s little in real life).  One of two 10''s from me.', '2008-09-22 06:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
