(4968570, 723709, 94265, '<td valign="top">The crop is a wee bit tight on the bottom but otherwise, it''s a well-lit, good clear shot. 7.</td>', 'The crop is a wee bit tight on the bottom but otherwise, it''s a well-lit, good clear shot. 7.', '2008-09-22 15:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
