(4969231, 723567, 45475, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: The first thing that strikes me here is the lean. The camera''s angle is at odds with the lines in the background, making it all look strangely drunken. On the floor? Maybe getting down to the same level rather than looking downward would have helped line everything up better. Also, could do with a bit more contrast and sharpness :)</td>', 'Back to comment: The first thing that strikes me here is the lean. The camera''s angle is at odds with the lines in the background, making it all look strangely drunken. On the floor? Maybe getting down to the same level rather than looking downward would have helped line everything up better. Also, could do with a bit more contrast and sharpness :)', '2008-09-22 22:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
