(4969878, 723735, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely nature macro - the shapes that the plant can give you depending on the angle are almost endless...and how the bug mirrors the A that is implied in the plant is just fantastic - great work - back for a bump</td>', 'lovely nature macro - the shapes that the plant can give you depending on the angle are almost endless...and how the bug mirrors the A that is implied in the plant is just fantastic - great work - back for a bump', '2008-09-23 12:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
