(4980144, 723568, 58691, '<td valign="top">Deb <br/>Congrats on this excellent image and on the 12th place finish. The detail is excellent and the ironwork appears to be consuming the spiderweb and growing from it. The shallow DOF and the amount of noise you left really complement the shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-11 21:40:25.</i></td>', 'Deb Congrats on this excellent image and on the 12th place finish. The detail is excellent and the ironwork appears to be consuming the spiderweb and growing from it. The shallow DOF and the amount of noise you left really complement the shot.', '2008-09-29 10:39:10.000000', '2008-10-11 22:40:25.000000', 0),
